==Description==
'''Clown''' is a sticker that can be purchased in the store for {{Coins|200}}.

==Appearance==
The sticker showcases the Level 4 {{Color|Premium|Clown}} [[Jester]] skin's head, though it uses its Level 0-1 mask instead of the Level 4 mask. It plays a healing sound when used as a placeholder.

==Trivia==
*The sound that plays when using the '''Clown''' sticker originates from ''Undertale''.

